.utmp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]serSettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset store / plugins caches
[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# IDE & Local Config
.vs/
.vscode/
.claude/settings.local.json
*.sln
*.slnx
